{"id":3093,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>为丰富院系文体生活，缓解学子学业压力，增强学生身体素质，培养学生团结协作、奋勇争先的优良品质，营造积极向上、活力满满的院系氛围，计算机科学与技术学院于2026 年 5 月 31 日在行知广场成功举办 “辉煌杯” 跳绳比赛。全院各年级学生踊跃参与，充分展现了计算机学子朝气蓬勃、锐意进取的青春风采。</p><p><strong>活动现场</strong></p><p>比赛期间，全体裁判与学生工作人员坚守岗位、认真负责，严格遵循公平、公正、公开原则，精准计时、计数、评分，确保赛事严谨有序。后勤人员全程在岗，全力做好赛场秩序维护、安全防护、物资补给与应急保障等服务，为参赛选手保驾护航。</p><p><strong>比赛项目及规则</strong></p><p>单人跳绳：以规定时间内完成的有效跳绳次数计算总成绩，按成绩从高到低排名；总成绩相同者，以失误次数少者排名靠前。</p><p>双摇跳绳：以规定时间内完成的有效双摇次数为总成绩，按成绩由高至低排名；成绩相同者，依次依据失误次数、动作连贯性确定名次。</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PozUYZLmT2UmvYL4mlbM4-bnR-YMmG8aL4MkMz6kM8W7nmN0gihFp2hmCIa0LYyPn1yDMkh7M7Q2L7r7nz-YUlnRM7nRU4viUmvDnNUiMmnFozrfU8-YL7rFLzliol-Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz-PMzLJqdinx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=12153&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/31F64D4FF0EDE22ADC4DCC75B76FD564/95ACB20E/1559B\" vheight=\"312\" vwidth=\"554\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Poz6Y2nNUDMzUDU44GaLzrRn7lYMNM8fMNlsLz9inzU4UzN0gihFp2hmCIa0okh2nSh2LkhfMz7PL498Ll-anzUsMNV2L8UPL87PLR9aLRrFU49bolr2UNrFUzNYUzlJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz-PMzLJqdinx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=12153&e=.png\"></p><p><strong>获奖情况</strong></p><p>经过紧张激烈的比拼与角逐，各位参赛选手以昂扬之姿、拼搏之态，在赛场上尽展风采、超越自我，凭借扎实的功底与稳定的发挥，斩获佳绩。现将获奖名单公布如下：</p><p>单摇比赛中，肖玉臣同学获一等奖、陈亮同学获二等奖、童俞锦同学获三等奖；双摇比赛中，郭胜伟同学获得一等奖、李凯乐同学获得二等奖、贺启泰同学获得三等奖。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PnR9YZn77YLNW7L4N7iU8UYU8rfLlU8Zozf7M87Ynmn7M7l0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyPnSyZUShRLNMVoRf7L7-bnlLZM4T2MmCYn7lsLmCDLmVFMmfRL7rVM4MFLzrRMR-Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz-PMzLJqdinx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=12153&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/11E8AC2CE80D0B9EC879F662DE726621/60C0EE73/15C42\" vheight=\"312\" vwidth=\"554\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Po7LYbM4liUmC4M48CiMR9PU8LZUz68VU4VVU494MlLsoR70gihFp2hmCIa0oShVM1ybn1hfM8C4MNWkUz7YLmCbnm9YUNn2MmAVMm74MzMFnmL4UlUbn7MFUzNYUzlJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz-PMzLJqdinx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=12153&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Pn7UYaLRCZMz7sU44C4olnRM4Uao778iM4NPUmCiLRfRM8L0gihFp2hmCIa0n1ysMYhRLkh7Uz6fUNWRLRl4MNCPUN-aozQ2L7Cioz9ZL7VFLRlZLzLbMzTFLzCbozCJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz-PMzLJqdinx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=12153&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F77C0DA7ABBC0536F1BB096F0F59880A/05813959/16996\" vheight=\"320\" vwidth=\"553\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PMmNYiU8Q2U878n4R-4LmvPLNQfLmM87MNC8L4-Pn7M7nR-0gihFp2hmCIa0MSybUYh7n1hfnNQkLNVkMmV2LzL8L4CsM7LPM7LDLzT7Um6FLRNbLlUanRTFUlU4L77Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz-PMzLJqdinx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=12153&e=.png\"></p><p><strong></strong><br></p><p>体育强则少年强，少年强则国强。跳绳作为简便易行、健身效果显著的全民运动，是我院推进体育育人、丰富课余生活的重要载体。本次比赛不仅为学子搭建了展示自我、比拼风采的平台，有效激发了全院运动热情、增强学生体质、舒缓学业压力，更厚植了阳光体育、快乐运动的院系文化氛围，推动我院文体活动持续蓬勃发展。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PUzTYVMRCPnNr7M4mARUm9iLzMVMNL8aLRvbozUiUmnknl70gihFp2hmCIa0n1yPn1hfn1hRnmnkLzCYo7-PUlC4L8LiM8lPMNCsoz-4LzTFM7UinmMkolWFLl7iLNCJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz-PMzLJqdinx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=12153&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F1FAFCF4B1628B1AF33C57E16F792319/4D5F3B9B/1A52F\" vheight=\"312\" vwidth=\"554\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PoRrY7U4AknlnRn4mNsUzQVnz78Mzf8fUNUYLm-8nzWknR90gihFp2hmCIa0L1yaU1yaLShVoRLbozlYL8MkozGaUzARL8QfMzVfMNLPo7rFMz7aU4QfMRTFUzNYUzlJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz-PMzLJqdinx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=12153&e=.png\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>计算机科学与技术学院文体部</p><p>2026年5月31日</p><p><br></p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://cst.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PozUYZLmT2UmvYL4mlbM4-bnR-YMmG8aL4MkMz6kM8W7nmN0gihFp2hmCIa0LYyPn1yDMkh7M7Q2L7r7nz-YUlnRM7nRU4viUmvDnNUiMmnFozrfU8-YL7rFLzliol-Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz-PMzLJqdinx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=12153&e=.png"}